[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0010","text":"哦哦～。比想象中好活动呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0020","text":"哦，是吗？\n看来你挺喜欢的啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0030","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0040","text":"像老鼠吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0050","text":"哈哈。也许吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0060","text":"还有……嗯，怎么说呢\n裙摆飘起来的感觉像乌鸦之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0070","text":"啊哈哈\n是这样吗！　乌鸦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0080","text":"还有！　还有别的吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0090","text":"哈哈哈……嗯——\n怎么说呢──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21701000_02_0100","text":"朝日什么都能变成哦"}]
